        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Large vertebra of the movable part of the vertebral column, characterized by the absence of the foramen transversarium within the transverse process, and by the absence of facets on the sides of the body.</obo:IAO_0000115>
