        <obo:UBPROP_0000008 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Whereas all rats had six lumbar vertebrae, variable patterns in mice included mostly five vertebrae in DBA/2J, mostly six vertebrae in C57BL/6J, and a mix in B6129PF2/J</obo:UBPROP_0000008>
