        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A plate of bone from the maxilla that that projects upward, medialward, and backward, by the side of the nose, forming part of its lateral boundary[WP,modified].</owl:annotatedTarget>
