        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The inferior pubic ramus is thin and flattened. It passes lateralward and downward from the medial end of the superior ramus; it becomes narrower as it descends and joins with the inferior ramus of the ischium below the obturator foramen.</obo:IAO_0000115>
