        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A bone fossa situated on the anterior part of the medial orbital wall, formed by the frontal process of the maxilla and the lacrimal bone; it lodges the lacrimal sac and communicates inferiorly with the nasolacrimal canal, which drains tears into the inferior nasal meatus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
