        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A zone of bone organ located on the inferior aspect of the lateral mass of the atlas (C1), presenting a flat to slightly concave articular surface that articulates with the superior articular facet of the axis to form the lateral atlantoaxial joint.</obo:IAO_0000115>
