        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A zone of bone organ located on the inferior articular process of the fourth thoracic vertebra, facing anteroinferiorly and oriented in the coronal plane. It articulates with the superior articular facet of T5, forming the zygapophyseal joint that constrains movement between adjacent mid-upper thoracic vertebrae.</obo:IAO_0000115>
