        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A zone of bone organ located on the inferior articular process of the twelfth thoracic vertebra. T12 is the most transitional thoracic vertebra; its inferior articular facets face laterally, closely resembling the lumbar pattern, and articulate with the superior articular facets of L1 at the thoracolumbar junction.</obo:IAO_0000115>
