            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A process of vertebra projecting inferiorly from the lateral mass of the atlas (C1), bearing a smooth articular facet that forms the lateral atlantoaxial joint with the superior articular process of the axis; it is positioned further anteriorly than in typical cervical vertebrae.</obo:IAO_0000115>
