        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A bone foramen forming the deep intercondylar fossa between the medial and lateral condyles on the posterior aspect of the distal femur. It provides passage for the anterior and posterior cruciate ligaments and is partially enclosed anteriorly by the patellar surface.</obo:IAO_0000115>
