        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A skeletal element projection situated at each superolateral angle of the dorsum sellae of the sphenoid bone, projecting anterolaterally; it provides attachment for the tentorium cerebelli and the petrosphenoidal ligament, and serves as a landmark for the abducens nerve as it bends over the petrous apex.</obo:IAO_0000115>
