        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A bone fossa formed by the concave medial surface of the lateral pterygoid plate facing the pterygoid process, situated between the lateral and medial pterygoid plates of the sphenoid bone; it provides origin for the medial pterygoid muscle and the lower belly of the lateral pterygoid muscle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
