        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A zone of bone organ forming the anterior extremity of the third rib that connects to the costal cartilage of the third rib. The third rib is a true rib whose costal cartilage articulates with the lateral border of the body of the sternum between the second and fourth costal notches.</obo:IAO_0000115>
