            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A zone of bone organ on the superior articular process of the fifth cervical vertebra (C5), presenting a smooth, obliquely oriented articular surface directed posterosuperiorly and medially to articulate with the inferior articular facet of C4 within the zygapophyseal joint.</obo:IAO_0000115>
