        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A zone of bone organ forming the articular surface on the superior articular process of the first lumbar vertebra, oriented in the sagittal plane with a concave, medially facing articular surface. It articulates with the inferior articular facet of the twelfth thoracic vertebra, forming the uppermost zygapophyseal joint of the lumbar column.</obo:IAO_0000115>
