        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A crest forming a horizontal ridge on the outer surface of the squamous part of the temporal bone, running posteriorly from the root of the zygomatic process superior to the external auditory meatus. It represents the inferior margin of the temporal surface and serves as a landmark for the suprameatal triangle.</obo:IAO_0000115>
