            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A neural arch forming the posterior bony ring of the sixth cervical vertebra (C6), composed of two pedicles and two laminae; it bears a bifid spinous process posteriorly and provides attachment for the semispinalis and multifidus muscles.</obo:IAO_0000115>
