        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A neural arch forming the posterior bony ring of the sixth cervical vertebra (C6), composed of two pedicles and two laminae; it bears a bifid spinous process posteriorly and provides attachment for the semispinalis and multifidus muscles.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">ISBN:9780323393225</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
