        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A neural arch forming the posterior bony ring of the third cervical vertebra (C3), composed of two pedicles and two laminae enclosing the vertebral foramen; it bears a small bifid spinous process posteriorly and the zygapophyseal articular processes laterally.</obo:IAO_0000115>
